<section id="how-it-works">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading reveal">
            <span class="kicker">How it works</span>
            <h2>Four steps from terminal to merged branch.</h2>
            <p>No new workflow — fleet sits on tools you already run.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="steps">
            <div class="step reveal">
                <div class="step-index">01</div>
                <h3>Pick a project</h3>
                <p>Run <code>fleet</code>, choose a project from your list of repos.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step reveal">
                <div class="step-index">02</div>
                <h3>Dashboard opens</h3>
                <p>One pane runs your agent, one runs the dashboard.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step reveal">
                <div class="step-index">03</div>
                <h3>Dispatch sub-orchestrators</h3>
                <p><code>fleet dispatch "&lt;task&gt;"</code> spins up a background agent in a hidden pane.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step reveal">
                <div class="step-index">04</div>
                <h3>Review, merge, finish</h3>
                <p>Dots turn from working to done. Merge, push, clean up.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
